# Base stacks (platform, permissions). Copy to base/.env — never commit.
#
# Local: export TF_VAR_<name>=<value> (matches variable names in .tf).
# Terraform Cloud: set the same keys as workspace / variable-set env vars
# (TF_VAR_ prefix) instead of a file — no secrets in VCS.
#
# Example (commented):
# TF_VAR_example=
